0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45.00 535.00 Td (pseudo-filesystem to extract real-time process statistics, build parent-child ancestry trees, track) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45.00 522.50 Td (lifecycle state changes, detect persistent resource consumption anomalies, optionally apply priority) Tj ET
